{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Battlesmiths: Blade & Forge",
    "steam_appid": 2583940,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battlesmiths</strong> is a tactical RPG with deep crafting, smart progression, and tactical squad-based battles. <br>Forge every weapon by hand. Upgrade every building. Conquer every challenge \u2014 your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd28 Crafting that matters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Battlesmiths</i>, gear isn\u2019t loot \u2014 it\u2019s the result of your labor. <br>Weapons and armor are crafted by you and directly affect how your heroes look and fight. Add runes to weapons for powerful abilities. Enchant armor to customize your squad. Customize the appearances of every hero the way you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfd9 Rebuild a broken town</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade blacksmiths, alchemists, miners and more. Each building adds new systems, from resource production to advanced gear recipes. Your town is the heart of your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Tactical, squad-based combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a team of up to four heroes in strategic semi-auto battles. <br>Choose gear carefully: classes are defined by weapon types, and every loadout impacts movement, damage, and attack speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d Multiple game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you love PvE or PvP, there\u2019s always something to conquer:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign</strong>: story-driven solo missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena</strong>: fight other players and prove you're the best</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Labyrinth</strong>: test your build in a brutal survival mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower of Trials</strong>: scaling challenges with high rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clan boss</strong>: cooperate to bring down a massive foe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure</strong>: limited-time missions and side quests</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 Progression with depth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need to manage resources, food, and materials wisely. Crafting, trading and combat feed into each other, creating a gameplay loop that rewards strategic planning and long-term growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83e\uddd1 Built for community</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a clan, duel friends, and help shape the game through feedback. <br>The world of <i>Battlesmiths</i> evolves \u2014 and you're part of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Available on PC, Mac, and mobile.  <br>\ud83d\udee0 Steam version currently in development. Wishlist now and join us on the forge floor.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battlesmiths</strong> is a tactical RPG with deep crafting, smart progression, and tactical squad-based battles. <br>Forge every weapon by hand. Upgrade every building. Conquer every challenge \u2014 your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd28 Crafting that matters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Battlesmiths</i>, gear isn\u2019t loot \u2014 it\u2019s the result of your labor. <br>Weapons and armor are crafted by you and directly affect how your heroes look and fight. Add runes to weapons for powerful abilities. Enchant armor to customize your squad. Customize the appearances of every hero the way you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfd9 Rebuild a broken town</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade blacksmiths, alchemists, miners and more. Each building adds new systems, from resource production to advanced gear recipes. Your town is the heart of your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Tactical, squad-based combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a team of up to four heroes in strategic semi-auto battles. <br>Choose gear carefully: classes are defined by weapon types, and every loadout impacts movement, damage, and attack speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d Multiple game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you love PvE or PvP, there\u2019s always something to conquer:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign</strong>: story-driven solo missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena</strong>: fight other players and prove you're the best</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Labyrinth</strong>: test your build in a brutal survival mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower of Trials</strong>: scaling challenges with high rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clan boss</strong>: cooperate to bring down a massive foe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure</strong>: limited-time missions and side quests</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 Progression with depth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need to manage resources, food, and materials wisely. Crafting, trading and combat feed into each other, creating a gameplay loop that rewards strategic planning and long-term growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83e\uddd1 Built for community</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a clan, duel friends, and help shape the game through feedback. <br>The world of <i>Battlesmiths</i> evolves \u2014 and you're part of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Available on PC, Mac, and mobile.  <br>\ud83d\udee0 Steam version currently in development. Wishlist now and join us on the forge floor.</p>",
    "short_description": "Craft weapons. Build your town. Command your squad. A tactical RPG where every piece of gear is forged by you \u2014 and every fight tests your strategy.",
